    19	So this is not another guard. It is a separation of powers. Agents *ask*; the gatekeeper
    20	checks the record itself, does exactly the one thing, and refuses everything else.
    21	
    22	FOUR RULES, and the design is mostly just these:
    23	
    24	  1. THREE VERBS. Not "run this for me". A gatekeeper that can be asked to run an
